//
// WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
// `worker/billing.ts` owns the dunning POLICY, and every constant that shapes it
// (`retryDayFor`, `CARD_SUSPEND_DAY`, `DUNNING_EXHAUSTED`, `SUSPEND_SLIP_CAP_DAYS`,
